{"2966300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sliding Hero", "steam_appid": 2966300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sliding Hero is a <strong>brainteasing, explorative puzzle game</strong> where you can only <strong>slide in a single direction</strong> until hitting an obstacle. <br> <br>Will you outsmart the villa’s many trials and unmask the truth behind your imprisonment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.poster.avif?t=1787586039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.webm?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.mp4?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PUZZLE METROIDVANIA OF MOVEMENT AND MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imprisoned in a sinister Venetian villa, <strong>use your wits to help Luca Sicomoro</strong>, a Serenissima military man, escape. <strong>Every move is a test of strategy</strong>, turning movement into a puzzle. Navigate a dark and intricate world inspired by <strong>1700s Venice and Carnival’s masked mystique,</strong> <strong>where danger and deception lurk in every shadow</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.poster.avif?t=1787586039\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.webm?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.mp4?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE SLIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use environmental hazards, weapons, artefacts, and your momentum to <strong>dispatch enemies and avoid deadly traps</strong>. Each encounter is a skill test, where <strong>puzzle-solving and combat seamlessly intertwine</strong> in an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master movement system.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/7041b400ce78b2ec0a4bdee779f5abd3.poster.avif?t=1787586039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/7041b400ce78b2ec0a4bdee779f5abd3.webm?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/7041b400ce78b2ec0a4bdee779f5abd3.mp4?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a498b85216f509da6cc4d2cd2e79c0e4.poster.avif?t=1787586039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a498b85216f509da6cc4d2cd2e79c0e4.webm?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a498b85216f509da6cc4d2cd2e79c0e4.mp4?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN INTERCONNECTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villa is a <strong>maze of hidden passageways, locked doors, and secrets</strong> waiting to be uncovered. <strong>Unlock new tools</strong> that let you <strong>backtrack</strong> to previously unreachable areas, <strong>forge shortcuts</strong>, and interact with the <strong>eccentric and enigmatic characters</strong> who dwell within.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.poster.avif?t=1787586039\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.webm?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.mp4?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DARK VENETIAN DREAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a beautifully hand-drawn pixel art world steeped in <strong>the elegance and unease of the Carnival of Venice</strong>. A haunting, original soundtrack inspired by <strong>Italian Baroque melodies</strong> enhances the atmosphere as you piece together <strong>a story of mystery, fate, and self-discovery</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/2ee78a6329d1fc356768c9f7b0da9d2d.poster.avif?t=1787586039\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/2ee78a6329d1fc356768c9f7b0da9d2d.webm?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/2ee78a6329d1fc356768c9f7b0da9d2d.mp4?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique puzzle-combat system</strong> built around momentum-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple weapons to unlock</strong>, each with a specific puzzle mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An atmospheric Venetian setting</strong>, blending historical beauty with eerie fantasy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Metroidvania exploration</strong>—discover new abilities to open fresh paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging and devious boss fights</strong>, where strategy is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced movement system</strong> designed with speedrunning in mind.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sliding Hero is a <strong>brainteasing, explorative puzzle game</strong> where you can only <strong>slide in a single direction</strong> until hitting an obstacle. <br> <br>Will you outsmart the villa’s many trials and unmask the truth behind your imprisonment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.poster.avif?t=1787586039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.webm?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.mp4?t=1787586039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PUZZLE METROIDVA